GNU Go 3.8 is distributed by the GNU project at
@url{https://www.gnu.org/software/gnugo/}. This version is built with
CMake; prebuilt programs for GNU/Linux, macOS and Windows, and a
WebAssembly build for web pages, are attached to the releases at
@url{https://github.com/abbychau/GNUgo/releases}.

